WEBVTT

00:00:00.684 --> 00:00:04.786
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> <b>The lazy person’s guide to a clean and tidy home</b>

00:00:06.378 --> 00:00:10.462
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I’m lazy, but I like living in a clean, tidy home.

00:00:11.204 --> 00:00:12.329
Maybe you’re the same.

00:00:12.852 --> 00:00:17.889
It doesn’t matter if you live by yourself, with a partner, or with a group of friends.

00:00:18.455 --> 00:00:20.871
You’re always going to have to do some housework.

00:00:21.728 --> 00:00:25.416
Learn a few cleaning tricks and you can have a clean home –

00:00:25.739 --> 00:00:29.787
and still have plenty of time to relax and do nothing.

00:00:31.028 --> 00:00:31.745
Tip one.

00:00:32.544 --> 00:00:34.591
Clean quickly, but often.

00:00:35.496 --> 00:00:37.851
Clean for just ten minutes twice a day.

00:00:38.697 --> 00:00:40.238
This gives you time to,

00:00:40.239 --> 00:00:44.285
for example, load the dishwasher and do one other thing

00:00:44.587 --> 00:00:45.441
like vacuuming.

00:00:46.166 --> 00:00:49.013
Set an alarm on your phone to motivate yourself.

00:00:50.454 --> 00:00:51.264
Tip two.

00:00:52.112 --> 00:00:54.648
Keep cleaning products in the right place.

00:00:55.362 --> 00:00:58.444
Put cleaning products near the place where you need them.

00:00:59.169 --> 00:01:01.214
Keep bathroom cleaners in the bathroom,

00:01:01.664 --> 00:01:03.397
keep bin bags by the bin,

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:07.053
and keep dishwasher tablets on top of the dishwasher.

00:01:08.069 --> 00:01:12.371
Sometimes you don’t clean if you can’t immediately see what you need,

00:01:12.969 --> 00:01:14.231
and you don’t want to look for it.

00:01:16.036 --> 00:01:16.739
Tip three.

00:01:17.509 --> 00:01:19.592
Clean the microwave regularly.

00:01:20.704 --> 00:01:25.525
You probably use this every day and it gets dirty quickly, believe me.

00:01:26.101 --> 00:01:28.062
But cleaning it is super easy.

00:01:28.385 --> 00:01:33.080
All you need to do is pour a little water into a microwave-safe bowl,

00:01:33.577 --> 00:01:36.958
slice a lemon in half and squeeze the juice into the water.

00:01:38.016 --> 00:01:41.205
Then, put the two halves of the lemon in the bowl

00:01:41.554 --> 00:01:44.327
and microwave on high for three minutes.

00:01:45.174 --> 00:01:47.956
Leave the door closed for another five minutes,

00:01:48.326 --> 00:01:50.594
and then clean the inside with a cloth.

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:53.261
Tip four.

00:01:53.817 --> 00:01:56.494
Use your dishwasher to clean other things.

00:01:57.464 --> 00:02:01.415
If you have a dishwasher, it’s probably already your best friend.

00:02:02.224 --> 00:02:05.756
But did you know that it can clean much more than just kitchen things?

00:02:06.364 --> 00:02:09.916
You can use it to clean all kinds of things made of plastic

00:02:10.128 --> 00:02:13.867
like toys, or even flip-flops or other plastic shoes,

00:02:14.238 --> 00:02:18.190
and also for things made of metal, like tools, or keys.

00:02:20.132 --> 00:02:21.092
Tip five.

00:02:21.719 --> 00:02:25.199
Tell people to take off their shoes when they come in.

00:02:26.130 --> 00:02:29.968
If you hate vacuuming, but you also hate the floor

00:02:29.969 --> 00:02:33.372
because you don’t do the vacuuming, there’s an easy solution –

00:02:34.001 --> 00:02:38.801
tell your housemates and guests to take off their shoes at the front door.

00:02:39.402 --> 00:02:43.737
And if they forget or refuse, give them the vacuum cleaner.

00:02:45.075 --> 00:02:45.833
Tip six.

00:02:46.829 --> 00:02:49.519
Use your socks to clean the floor.

00:02:50.565 --> 00:02:54.472
If you have a hard floor, like wood or stone, for example,

00:02:54.853 --> 00:02:56.693
make your socks work for you.

00:02:57.503 --> 00:03:03.242
Take your shoes off, and slide across a different part of your floor each time you move across it.

00:03:03.939 --> 00:03:05.954
It’ll soon be completely clean.

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:09.827
Then, just throw your socks in the washing machine.

00:03:11.092 --> 00:03:13.271
And finally, tip seven.

00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:16.479
Listen to music while you clean.

00:03:17.404 --> 00:03:21.136
Sometimes you really need to do some housework that you hate,

00:03:21.464 --> 00:03:24.176
like ironing or cleaning the bathroom.

00:03:24.996 --> 00:03:28.057
Put on your favourite playlist and focus on the music,

00:03:28.359 --> 00:03:29.905
not the boring housework.

00:03:30.873 --> 00:03:35.006
And one last word – many people say that lazy people

00:03:35.201 --> 00:03:36.966
are often the best employees

00:03:37.253 --> 00:03:40.282
because they find the most efficient way to complete a task.

00:03:41.097 --> 00:03:44.328
That’s the way you need to think when you’re cleaning.

00:03:45.360 --> 00:03:45.946
Good luck!